### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "other@example.com", "password": "SuperSecret123"}

### Login (stores the token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "me@example.com", "password": "SuperSecret123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "me@example.com", "password": "wrong-password"}

### Create a link as me
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"url": "https://spring.io"}

> {% client.global.set("code", response.body.shortCode); %}

### My links
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My links without a token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls

### Delete my link (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/{{code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stats for my link (last 7 days)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/{{code}}/stats?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simulated click: iPhone Safari arriving from Hacker News
GET http://localhost:8080/{{code}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_0 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/17.0 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1
Referer: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=1

### Simulated click: Windows Chrome arriving from Google
GET http://localhost:8080/{{code}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36
Referer: https://www.google.com/search?q=shortly